  "document": "Freek van de Graaff\nFrederik Robbert \"Freek\" van de Graaff (20 February 1944 – 24 June 2009) was a Dutch rower who won a bronze medal in the coxed fours at the 1964 Summer Olympics. His team mates were Marius Klumperbeek (cox), Lex Mullink, Bobbie van de Graaf and Jan van de Graaff. The three \"van de Graaf(f)s\" were all born in 1944."
